  - name: Bayreuth Zielpfad Gesamtstadt (city workbook)
    authority: Stadt Bayreuth -- Klimaschutzmanagement
    url:
    description: "The city's workbook with four sheets: Zielpfad neu THG (measured
      emissions 2019-2024 by Wärme/Strom/Verkehr, the 2021 linear target path, and
      the new sector target path 2025-2040, all in t CO2e/a), Messwerte Endenergie,
      Zielpfad_2021 and Senken. Read by scripts/extract_zielpfad.py and scripts/create_zielpfad_csv.py
      (Zielpfad neu THG only). The Drive folder holds it twice, byte-identical, as
      Zielpfad Gesamtstadt Aug2026.xlsx and Zielpfad Gesamtstadt NEU.xlsx. Against
      the April edition (client-archive/) Zielpfad neu THG and Messwerte Endenergie
      are unchanged; Senken now gives areas for 1990 and 2010 instead of 2019 and
      2020, and Zielpfad_2021 changes in one cell.; Attachment: Zielpfad Gesamtstadt
      Aug2026.xlsx; Format: .xlsx; Licensing: Provided by the city; not public; Geographic
      Coverage: Bayreuth (AGS 09462000); Update Frequency: Irregular; Date Last Updated:
      2026-07-15; Updated by: Stadt Bayreuth"
    edition:
    target: data_point
  index_columns:
  - Year
  - sector
  - energy_carrier
  updated_at: '1790863101'
  units:
